{"id": "0x00DD", "plain_text": "You mastered the secret sword\ntechnique of the Spin Attack!\n--- PAGE ---\nHold [B] to charge your weapon!\nRelease [B] to unleash a wave\nof energy with your spin!\n--- PAGE ---\nIf you want to release energy\nwithout charging your weapon, just \nrotate [D-Pad] once and press [B] for\na very effective quick spin!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "UNSKIPPABLE", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["B", "D-Pad"], "choices": []}
