{"id": "0x00E7", "plain_text": "When you charge power for a Spin\nAttack, magic power will be\nconsumed. Pay attention to your\ngreen Magic Meter!\n--- PAGE ---\nHey, boy! You're a messenger of\nthe Royal Family, aren't you?\n--- PAGE ---\nNext time you're in their\nneighborhood, you should drop in\non a friend of mine who lives by\nHyrule Castle.\n--- PAGE ---\nShe'll surely grant you another\nnew power!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_66)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
