{"id": "0x00FB", "plain_text": "WINNER!\n--- PAGE ---\nYou got a Piece of Heart!\nSo far, you've collected two \npieces. With two more pieces, \nyou will gain more life energy!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["SHIFT", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "ITEM_ICON", "QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x00FC", "plain_text": "WINNER!\n--- PAGE ---\nYou got a Piece of Heart!\nYou've collected three pieces!\nWith another piece, your life \nenergy will be powered up!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["SHIFT", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "ITEM_ICON", "QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x00FD", "plain_text": "WINNER!\n--- PAGE ---\nYou got a Piece of Heart!\nYou've completed another Heart\nContainer! Your maximum life\nenergy is increased!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["SHIFT", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "ITEM_ICON", "QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x00FE", "plain_text": "Look for them not only out in the\nopen, but also inside the dungeons.\n--- PAGE ---\nOf course, this is just our dream...\nYou don't have to do it if you\ndon't want to...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "TEXTID"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0100", "plain_text": "What's that?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0101", "plain_text": "Look, look, [PLAYER]!\nYou can see down below this web\nusing [C-Right]!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NAME", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_70)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["C-Right"], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0102", "plain_text": "Look at this wall! The vines\ngrowing on it give it a rough\nsurface... Maybe you can climb \nit, [PLAYER]!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "NAME", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0103", "plain_text": "You can open a door by standing\nin front of it and pressing [A].\n--- PAGE ---\nPay attention to what the\nAction Icon says.\nThat's the blue icon at the top of\nthe screen!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_67)", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["A"], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0104", "plain_text": "Look! Something is hanging up\nthere! It looks like an old ladder!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0105", "plain_text": "Hey...\nIsn't that the same design that's\non the Door of Time?", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0106", "plain_text": "It looks like that torch was\nburning not too long ago...", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0107", "plain_text": "From here on, we'll be going\nthrough some narrow passages!\nIf you take it slow, maybe you\ncan sneak up on some enemies.\n--- PAGE ---\nUse [C-Left] Targeting to always look\nin the proper direction. Set your\nview so you can see down the next\ncorridor before you turn a corner.\n--- PAGE ---\nOnce your view is set, hold down\n[C-Left] to sidestep around the corner.\nThat way you won't be surprised\nby an enemy waiting in ambush.", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["C-Left"], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0108", "plain_text": "Stand next to this block and grab\nhold of it with [A]. While holding\n[A], you can push or pull it.\n--- PAGE ---\nIf you stand next to the block\nand press [A] while pressing [D-Pad]\ntowards the block, you can climb\non top of it.\n--- PAGE ---\nPay attention to what the Action\nIcon says!", "category": "NPC_DIALOGUE", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_67)", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["A", "D-Pad"], "choices": []}
